    &lt;/span&gt;        
    
&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div id=&#34;gallery-2f67918d170480379009d3c9c6c600ed&#34; class=&#34;gallery&#34;&gt;
  
  
    
&lt;figure class=&#34;grid-w50 pb-4 text-center&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://mis3085.github.io/docs-chinyi/cy101_5969020428906885198.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;Machine d&#39;inspection des capsules / comprimés CY-101&#34; class=&#34;mx-auto max-w-full h-auto&#34;/&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;Machine d&#39;inspection des capsules / comprimés CY-101&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;
